{"surah":86,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"86:1","arabic":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"By the sky and the night comer","id":"Demi langit dan yang datang pada malam hari.","words":[{"a":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","en":"By the sky","id":"By the sky"},{"a":"وَٱلطَّارِقِ","en":"and the night comer","id":"and the night comer"}]},{"n":2,"key":"86:2","arabic":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"And what can make you know what is the night comer?","id":"Dan tahukah kamu apakah yang datang pada malam hari itu?","words":[{"a":"وَمَآ","en":"And what","id":"And what"},{"a":"أَدۡرَىٰكَ","en":"can make you know","id":"can make you know"},{"a":"مَا","en":"what","id":"what"},{"a":"ٱلطَّارِقُ","en":"the night comer (is)","id":"the night comer (is)"}]},{"n":3,"key":"86:3","arabic":"ٱلنَّجۡمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"It is the piercing star","id":"(Yaitu) bintang yang bersinar tajam,","words":[{"a":"ٱلنَّجۡمُ","en":"(It is) the star","id":"(It is) the star"},{"a":"ٱلثَّاقِبُ","en":"the piercing","id":"the piercing"}]},{"n":4,"key":"86:4","arabic":"إِن كُلُّ نَفۡسٖ لَّمَّا عَلَيۡهَا حَافِظٞ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector.","id":"setiap orang pasti ada penjaganya.","words":[{"a":"إِن","en":"Not","id":"Not"},{"a":"كُلُّ","en":"(is) every","id":"(is) every"},{"a":"نَفۡسٖ","en":"soul","id":"soul"},{"a":"لَّمَّا","en":"but","id":"but"},{"a":"عَلَيۡهَا","en":"over it","id":"over it"},{"a":"حَافِظٞ","en":"(is) a protector","id":"(is) a protector"}]},{"n":5,"key":"86:5","arabic":"فَلۡيَنظُرِ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"So let man observe from what he was created.","id":"Maka hendaklah manusia memperhatikan dari apa dia diciptakan.","words":[{"a":"فَلۡيَنظُرِ","en":"So let see","id":"So let see"},{"a":"ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","en":"man","id":"man"},{"a":"مِمَّ","en":"from what","id":"from what"},{"a":"خُلِقَ","en":"he is created","id":"he is created"}]},{"n":6,"key":"86:6","arabic":"خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٖ دَافِقٖ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"He was created from a fluid, ejected,","id":"Dia diciptakan dari air (mani) yang terpancar,","words":[{"a":"خُلِقَ","en":"He is created","id":"He is created"},{"a":"مِن","en":"from","id":"from"},{"a":"مَّآءٖ","en":"a water","id":"a water"},{"a":"دَافِقٖ","en":"ejected","id":"ejected"}]},{"n":7,"key":"86:7","arabic":"يَخۡرُجُ مِنۢ بَيۡنِ ٱلصُّلۡبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs.","id":"yang keluar dari antara tulang punggung (sulbi) dan tulang dada.","words":[{"a":"يَخۡرُجُ","en":"Coming forth","id":"Coming forth"},{"a":"مِنۢ","en":"from","id":"from"},{"a":"بَيۡنِ","en":"between","id":"between"},{"a":"ٱلصُّلۡبِ","en":"the backbone","id":"the backbone"},{"a":"وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","en":"and the ribs","id":"and the ribs"}]},{"n":8,"key":"86:8","arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَجۡعِهِۦ لَقَادِرٞ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, He [i.e., Allāh], to return him [to life], is Able.","id":"Sungguh, Allah benar-benar kuasa untuk mengembalikannya (hidup setelah mati).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّهُۥ","en":"Indeed, He","id":"Indeed, He"},{"a":"عَلَىٰ","en":"to","id":"to"},{"a":"رَجۡعِهِۦ","en":"return him","id":"return him"},{"a":"لَقَادِرٞ","en":"(is) Able","id":"(is) Able"}]},{"n":9,"key":"86:9","arabic":"يَوۡمَ تُبۡلَى ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial,","id":"Pada hari ditampakkan segala rahasia,","words":[{"a":"يَوۡمَ","en":"(The) Day","id":"(The) Day"},{"a":"تُبۡلَى","en":"will be tested","id":"will be tested"},{"a":"ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","en":"the secrets","id":"the secrets"}]},{"n":10,"key":"86:10","arabic":"فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن قُوَّةٖ وَلَا نَاصِرٖ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"Then he [i.e., man] will have no power or any helper.","id":"maka manusia tidak lagi mempunyai suatu kekuatan dan tidak (pula) ada penolong.","words":[{"a":"فَمَا","en":"Then not","id":"Then not"},{"a":"لَهُۥ","en":"(is) for him","id":"(is) for him"},{"a":"مِن","en":"any","id":"any"},{"a":"قُوَّةٖ","en":"power","id":"power"},{"a":"وَلَا","en":"and not","id":"and not"},{"a":"نَاصِرٖ","en":"any helper","id":"any helper"}]},{"n":11,"key":"86:11","arabic":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلرَّجۡعِ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"By the sky which sends back","id":"Demi langit yang mengandung hujan,","words":[{"a":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","en":"By the sky","id":"By the sky"},{"a":"ذَاتِ","en":"which","id":"which"},{"a":"ٱلرَّجۡعِ","en":"returns","id":"returns"}]},{"n":12,"key":"86:12","arabic":"وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ ذَاتِ ٱلصَّدۡعِ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"And [by] the earth which splits,","id":"dan bumi yang mempunyai tumbuh-tumbuhan,","words":[{"a":"وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ","en":"And the earth","id":"And the earth"},{"a":"ذَاتِ","en":"which","id":"which"},{"a":"ٱلصَّدۡعِ","en":"cracks open","id":"cracks open"}]},{"n":13,"key":"86:13","arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوۡلٞ فَصۡلٞ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a decisive statement,","id":"sungguh, (Alquran) itu benar-benar firman pemisah (antara yang hak dan yang batil),","words":[{"a":"إِنَّهُۥ","en":"Indeed, it","id":"Indeed, it"},{"a":"لَقَوۡلٞ","en":"(is) surely a Word","id":"(is) surely a Word"},{"a":"فَصۡلٞ","en":"decisive","id":"decisive"}]},{"n":14,"key":"86:14","arabic":"وَمَا هُوَ بِٱلۡهَزۡلِ","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"And it is not amusement.","id":"dan (Alquran) itu bukanlah senda gurauan.","words":[{"a":"وَمَا","en":"And not","id":"And not"},{"a":"هُوَ","en":"it","id":"it"},{"a":"بِٱلۡهَزۡلِ","en":"(is) for amusement","id":"(is) for amusement"}]},{"n":15,"key":"86:15","arabic":"إِنَّهُمۡ يَكِيدُونَ كَيۡدٗا","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, they are planning a plan,","id":"Sungguh, mereka (orang kafir) merencanakan tipu daya yang jahat,","words":[{"a":"إِنَّهُمۡ","en":"Indeed, they","id":"Indeed, they"},{"a":"يَكِيدُونَ","en":"are plotting","id":"are plotting"},{"a":"كَيۡدٗا","en":"a plot","id":"a plot"}]},{"n":16,"key":"86:16","arabic":"وَأَكِيدُ كَيۡدٗا","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"But I am planning a plan.","id":"dan Aku pun membuat rencana (tipu daya) yang jitu.","words":[{"a":"وَأَكِيدُ","en":"But I am planning","id":"But I am planning"},{"a":"كَيۡدٗا","en":"a plan","id":"a plan"}]},{"n":17,"key":"86:17","arabic":"فَمَهِّلِ ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ أَمۡهِلۡهُمۡ رُوَيۡدَۢا","page":591,"juz":30,"en":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile.","id":"Karena itu berilah penangguhan kepada orang-orang kafir. Berilah mereka kesempatan untuk sementara waktu.","words":[{"a":"فَمَهِّلِ","en":"So give respite","id":"So give respite"},{"a":"ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ","en":"(to) the disbelievers","id":"(to) the disbelievers"},{"a":"أَمۡهِلۡهُمۡ","en":"Give respite to them ","id":"Give respite to them "},{"a":"رُوَيۡدَۢا","en":"little","id":"little"}]}]}